@startuml fig4-expense
!include style.iuml
title Figure 4 (revises 2.2 Figure 4): Create an expense with a split preview (FR 2.1 to 2.6, 2.9, 3.1 to 3.7; D2, D3)

actor User
participant ":ExpenseFormActivity" as UI
participant ":ExpenseViewModel" as VM
participant ":GroupRepository" as GR
participant ":UserRepository" as UR
participant "Money" as M
participant ":SplitCalculator" as SC
participant ":InputValidator" as V
participant ":DateProvider" as D
participant ":TransactionRepository" as TR
participant "db :\nFirebaseFirestore" as DB

User -> UI : tap Add expense
UI -> VM : <b>init(groupId, null)</b>
VM -> GR : <b>getGroup(groupId, cb)</b>
VM -> UR : <b>getUsers(group.memberIds, cb)</b>
note right of VM
  category chip = OTHER,
  payer = current user, preselected
  as a participant (cannot be unchecked)
end note

loop each change to total, payer, participants, split method or a share input
  User -> UI : edit a field
  UI -> VM : setTotal(text) / setPayer(uid) /\ntoggleParticipant(uid, <b>checked</b>) /\nsetSplitMethod(m) / setSplitInput(uid, text)
  VM -> M : parseDollars(text) <b>(setTotal only)</b>
  M --> VM : <b>totalCents</b> (or InvalidAmountException)
  VM -> VM : recomputePreview()
  note right of VM
    CHANGED: recomputePreview() parses each share input itself
    (a bad entry is flagged on its own row), and checkPercentages /
    checkSum run only once every selected participant has a valid
    entry; an equal split needs no checkSum
  end note
  alt splitMethod == EQUAL
    VM -> SC : splitEqual(totalCents, ids)
  else splitMethod == PERCENTAGE
    VM -> M : <b>parsePercent(text) for each participant</b>
    VM -> SC : splitByPercent(totalCents, <b>percents : LinkedHashMap</b>)
    VM -> SC : checkPercentages(percents)
    VM -> SC : checkSum(totalCents, shares)
  else splitMethod == EXACT
    VM -> M : <b>parseDollars(text) for each participant</b>
    VM -> SC : splitExact(<b>amounts : LinkedHashMap</b>)
    VM -> SC : checkSum(totalCents, shares)
  end
  SC --> VM : shares, results
  VM --> UI : <b>splitStatus : SplitStatus</b> and <b>rows : List<ParticipantRow></b> (LiveData)
  UI --> User : each participant's share and e.g.\n"Amounts add up to $28.00, not $30.00 <b>($2.00 left to assign)</b>"
end

User -> UI : enter title, pick category, note; tap Save
UI -> VM : save(title, category, note)
VM -> VM : <b>recomputePreview()</b>
note right of VM
  CHANGED: save() checks the title and total, re-runs the
  preview and stops unless the split is valid, all before
  the expense is built (2.2 checked the split only after
  validateExpense)
end note
break title or total missing, fewer than two participants, or split not valid
  VM --> UI : <b>fieldError (LiveData)</b>
  UI --> User : error shown on the field (for the split: a message\nand a scroll to the preview), nothing saved
end
VM -> D : today(), <b>nowMillis()</b>
D --> VM : "YYYY-MM-DD", time
VM -> VM : expense = new Expense(...)
VM -> V : validateExpense(expense, group)
V --> VM : result
alt result not valid
  VM --> UI : <b>fieldError (LiveData)</b>
  UI --> User : error shown on the field, nothing saved
else valid
  VM -> TR : addExpense(expense, <b>nowMillis</b>, cb)
  TR -> DB : set groups/{groupId}/transactions/{newId}
  DB --> TR : ok
  TR --> VM : cb.onSuccess(id)
  VM --> UI : <b>saved (Event)</b>
  UI --> User : form closes; history, balances and\nsummary reload when shown (FR 2.9)
end

legend bottom left
<b>Bold</b> messages and notes marked NEW or CHANGED are departures from Project 2.2; plain = unchanged.
endlegend
@enduml
